{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Jesús Menéndez (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that after <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jesús_Menéndez\" title=\"Jesús Menéndez\">Jesús Menéndez</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> was unanimously reelected to lead the Cuban sugar workers' union in 1947, the government declared the election illegal and seized his offices?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jes%C3%BAs_Men%C3%A9ndez","retrieved":1792664913547},{"title":"a Peppa Pig character (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the birth of <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Evie_Pig\" title=\"Evie Pig\">a <i>Peppa Pig</i> character</a></b> was announced by a town crier outside <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St_Mary's_Hospital,_London\" title=\"St Mary's Hospital, London\">St Mary's Hospital, London</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Evie_Pig","retrieved":1792664913548},{"title":"Prince Edward Road MRT station (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prince_Edward_Road_MRT_station\" title=\"Prince Edward Road MRT station\">Prince Edward Road MRT station</a></b> has tunnels that were constructed only 3.9 metres (13 ft) from the foundations of a commercial building?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prince_Edward_Road_MRT_station","retrieved":1792664913550},{"title":"Richard Ten Broeck (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richard_Ten_Broeck\" title=\"Richard Ten Broeck\">Richard Ten Broeck</a></b> started an \"American invasion\" of British horse racing?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richard_Ten_Broeck","retrieved":1792664913553},{"title":"Great Upon Little (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that there used to be 30 climbing routes for <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Upon_Little\" title=\"Great Upon Little\">Great Upon Little</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Upon_Little","retrieved":1792664913555},{"title":"Julia Hermosilla (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Julia_Hermosilla\" title=\"Julia Hermosilla\">Julia Hermosilla</a></b> attempted to assassinate Francisco Franco twice?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Julia_Hermosilla","retrieved":1792664913557},{"title":"Army Derby (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the only <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_teams_that_have_overcome_3–0_series_deficits\" title=\"List of teams that have overcome 3–0 series deficits\">reverse sweep</a> in the history of Russia's Kontinental Hockey League happened in the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Army_Derby\" title=\"Army Derby\">Army Derby</a></b> in 2015?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Army_Derby","retrieved":1792664913561},{"title":"a science teacher (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ellen_Wille\" title=\"Ellen Wille\">a science teacher</a></b> was the first woman to speak at a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/FIFA_Congress\" title=\"FIFA Congress\">FIFA Congress</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ellen_Wille","retrieved":1792664913561},{"title":"Blue Whale Unit (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Whale_Unit\" title=\"Blue Whale Unit\">Blue Whale Unit</a></b> was equal to one blue whale, two fin whales, two and a half humpback whales, or six sei whales?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Whale_Unit","retrieved":1792664913566},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","con